COMMENT     STRAIN: 5557_RSV_F_B1_R429M
            Full VEP cloned into HDM and sequence confirmed by Twist. This
            plasmid is codon optimized based on its subtype. If subtype A it is
            in RSV Long F by GenScript (optimization #4). If subtype B it is in
            the background of the RSV B1 F codon optimization. All Fs have full
            cytoplasmic tail. This order is for all F strains requested for RSV
            Long F DMS validations. Designed by Teagan McMahon in October 2025,
            see computational notebook for more details.
